        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "In Grow Home you play as BUD (Botanical Utility Droid), a robot on a mission to save his home planet by harvesting the seeds of a giant alien plant. On his quest BUD will discover a beautiful world of floating islands that are home to some rather strange plants and animals.\nGrow the giant plant and use your unique climbing abilities to reach ever higher ground, but be careful…one wrong move and it’s a long way down!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "En Grow Home controlas a BUD (Botanical Utility Droid), un robot con la misión de salvar su planeta natal recolectando las semillas de una planta alienígena gigante. En su viaje, BUD descubrirá un hermoso mundo de islas flotantes que albergan plantas y animales bastante extraños.\nHaz crecer la planta gigante y usa tus habilidades únicas de escalada para alcanzar terrenos cada vez más altos, pero ten cuidado… ¡un paso en falso y caerás de muy alto!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
